<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Oyakubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa bwabo ko Oyakubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oyakubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oyk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa bwabo ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Oyakubu</para>
  <para style="imt">Okwotu</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ena bwabo ko Oyakubu </char> ela ni okpo tukpa kweyi tokpa ga dawase ko &lt;&lt;Owuso ni ebebenya ipu kese kpiri ni.&gt;&gt; inotokpa kawela nyakwu-nyakwu bwebe ko gyogye nu kpo oziyi nu ko tawase ni ba gboso Oyesu ni otugbagba ebe kawoza shishi ni byo Odu kpe Eha, omama, yoza neshi, shepwo meme, otuse kpo oyoya, oko gigbenu, oziyi, apwo gbogbo, akyagwogwa kpo geyagye, sha ase epwo gase, gwabotu kpo zotu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Okpa mani kela kotata ikweyi koneshi koza yoya kotuse ipu ko owe ko gboso Oyesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Awoza ni okwu tiriri bama</para>
  <para style="io1">Ikweyi kela (1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Otuse kpo Oziyi (1.2-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Oleha kpo Olodu (1.9-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ogyama kpo Omama (1.12-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Opwopwo kpo Oyoya (1.19-27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Akpaha popi ikweyi ko tela kase (2.1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Otuse kpo oko yoya (2.14-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ase ni ya gbose kpi igbenu nu (3.1-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ase ni ya gboso Oyesu kpe ese (4.1-5,6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Awi ikweyi kela gogo-gogo (5.7-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Ogbogba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Enena mani bwabo hin Oyakubu, oshe ko Owuso kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Gebe ka awose igwepa ni pasha ebebenya ipu kese kpiri ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otuse kpo Oziyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Ayene hin, ala ziyi kala mala shotunehe ishini amalama owe gogo-gogo ni, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ikweyi koni alagye mo, otuse kala ya gye owoni amalama kweyi oya yala ba zotu. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ala zotu kpo ojoji shini ala gye kweyi ki gyogya ipu ko Omaku, ojije naka nyala lo. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Owoni ashe kala gbo oziyi lo, ona bo Owuso, ni ya dala oza ni; ikweyi koni Owuso ya da anano oza yeye kpo otu oye kponu. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ishini oke ya tinarigwu, owotiri shini okyogwu kpotu oye kponu. Ikweyi koni ine kotu epa lema byo ogwa kishu ni owu ya to geye giso ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Edo kase mani naka yo otuse manu ya pyoje ebe ka Adole lo. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Ikweyi koni owine kotu epa, oya hikpo oye kponu lo ipu koza yo ya nu kpiri.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oleha kpo Olodu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Ayene ni wo oleha ni, na shotunehe do Owuso ishini ozuwa iso ni, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />mamani owotiri da ayene ni wo olodu, ana shotunehe do Owuso ishini okwikye awa itikpi ni. Ikweyi koni odu ya kweyi byo oshepu ki ikyashi ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ishini eno weyi, oyasi ikyashi, oshepu nu ba gwo shonu, ome oshinu ya kweyi, mamani olodu ya gekwu sho otoyu nu bita.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omama kpo Omape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Otunehe yo kpa awase ni zotu ishini amuwama, ishini ayo omama mani gwagye, aba pya abola ko olayi ko gbogbo-gbogbo ni Owuso shokoyi dawo yimu nu ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Awase ni amuwama, ana ka kamo, Owuso pini muwama la lo. Ikweyi koni aba mo Owuso ma kpo ozalabi lo, anu abiyinu ke ya mashishe ma lo. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Imu oza kaha bwowe ni shoshi lo ni pini yaha ba gbo gipu ko ozalabi la. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ishini imu ko ozalabi bipu oya mo ozalabi, ishini ozalabi gyagwu oya mi ikwu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ayene hin moshi, ashishe naka gyalegya lo! <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Eshi kpiri ni shoshi kiyo gyogye ni yawa bwi iso la; ya sa bwebe ko Owuso, ino ya awoyoyu ki iso, ni ya pya lo oke ya yebe dibu bwebe ko pyopya nu lo. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Bwebe kimu kotu nu oyaha bwebe kela ko okwokwoshi, shini ahan wa kikyikyo ipu kawoza kpiri ni oya ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Opwopwo kpo Oyoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Ayene hin moshi! Ela mani na yipu kotu kala, ananoho naya papa ko pwela, oke naka ya papa ko kela lo, naka ya papa ko kyanya lo. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Anya kyokye kasuse ya byoza neshi ni Owuso ya yimu ni wa lo. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Mani oni, ahan shoza kobwa kpo ozalabi kpiri bita. Ala kpotu so Owuso shini ala zela ni oya tu ipu kotu kala, ni ya gege ko ngma la ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Ala ka gyiyikala egya ko pwela kin lo; ala wawo yoko kpoza ni ala pwo ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Owoni ala pwela kin kweyi yoko kpanu lo, ala lema byawase ni miyiwa ipu ki iyimebe ko moza ni awe ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Amiyiwa neneshi kweyi ashebe ni bita, ebebeni anwanyi oza ni awe ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Owoni ala ke yiyi kwo ono ni ya dase ominyo ni, kweyi gbera kpanu ki pwo yeye ko nwanyi kpanu lo, ke ba yoko kpanu. Owuso ya sa ala aboneshi ipu kojoji ni ala ba ya ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Owoni ashe kala manu ya gboso Owuso kweyi ogege kwigbenu nu lo, oya gyiyinu egya oma, ogboso Owuso nu woyeye la. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Oza ni Owuso Ada mo owoneshi kpo okwokwoshi ko gboso ni yoma: tayokwu kpa anyokwu abo ipu ko owe ni aba mani, kweyi ka yese na yo yishi lo.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi Ikweyi Kepwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Ayene hin, byoni ala wawo kyogwu ipu ka Adole Oyesu Okristi ni wa Adole kigyashi ni, ala ka zashe shashe bwebe ko moma kiyi lo. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Owoni olodu oye la arika ko ozinariya kpo oshiye neshi wogbayi kala, kweyi oleha oye ni lashigiri ni wipu mamani. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Owoni ala ma ase ni shoshiye neshi ni gyiyi she kweyi ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Yagye oka ni shoshi she kpiri mani,&gt;&gt; kweyi ka do oleha mo, &lt;&lt;Hagye ebe ni kwe yagye okpagye obutu hin,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />ala gbepwo ko zashe shashe ipu kala, kpa ko miyi kala kpo otu oye hoha. <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Ala pwo ayene hin! Owuso shawo oleha kese mani ko wo olodu ipu kotuse ko ki rogwu ko obula no Owuso shokoyi ko dawase ni ba yimu nu ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ala ke ba mawo oleha gyiyi lo! Awanoho ba dala owe kweyi ba pyala gebe kawo kepwo? Awolodu la lo? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Awa pini ba kela bibi ikweyi kiye neneshi ni adala oni la.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ala yoza neshi, owoni ala gboso ono ko Obula byoni okpa ko Owuso ka ni mo, &lt;&lt;Yimu kase ni ala bagye dudu ni byoni oya yimu kiyo ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Owoni ala ke mashe shashe byoni ala muwa kiyi ni, ala yozalabi, kweyi Ono kwala epwo mala wawo yo ono kyigbo. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ase ni yo ono oye kigbo, ogbepwo ko yo ono kpiri kigbo oma. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Koni ase ni kamo, ka beba lo ni, anu pini kamo, ka ngmase lo la. Owoni obeba lo oke ngmase, oyo ono kigbo koni ongmase ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ela koka kala kpoza yoya kala na le bya kase ni aba wa kepwo wa kpo ono ni ya ngmaha ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ikweyi koni ase ni gbiyinyinyi kase lo; Owuso ya miyinyinyi nu ebe kepwo koka lo; iyinyinyi ke loshu shepwo koka.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otuse kpo Oko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Ayene hin, owoni ase manu gbo otuse kweyi oyoko lo, oji woneshi nu? Edo kotuse mani ya gege ya ngmanu? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Ana kamo oyene oye, onya kwe ongo gbo ozarore kpo oshiye lo. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Owoni ashe kala ka danu mo, &lt;&lt;Owuso na yo oneshi; shoshiye neshi, kweyi roza yipu!&gt;&gt; Kweyi oke dawo ojije ko tuwabo ipu ko olayi wa lo? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Mamani, owoni otuse gboko lo, owo okwu pini yoma.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ashe ke ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Awo gbo otuse kweyi, ashe gbo oko.&gt;&gt; Nkyogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Shami otuse wo ni gboko lo ni. Ami ke ya shawo otuse hin bwebe ko oko ni nyya ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Owoni okyogwu mo Owuso woye, oshoshi! Omaku bibi kyogwu mamani, kpi ikpiye wode kpo oshi yoya mo Owuso woye. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Awo ikyo! Oya yimu na ki shawo mo otuse ni gboko lo woyeye? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Ayamoji zo okyikyi kaha ki Ibirayi wa aseneshi ebe ko Owuso? Bwebe ko oko ni oya ni lalo? Ni ozo oyi nu Ishaku koyi peshi okpe ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Awo ma lo? Otuse nu kpo oko nu yawu dudu; kweyi otuse nu woneshi bwebe ko oko noya ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Okpa ko Owuso ko kwokwoshi mo, &lt;&lt;Ibirayi kyogwu kpo Owuso, ikweyi kotuse nu Owuso mo wase neshi.&gt;&gt; Mani oni, Owuso yi Ibirayi ogwu mo owoya nu. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Ala ma, aba yase wase neshi ko Owuso bwebe ko oko yoya nu la, wo otuse nu kin la lo. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Ogbodagye mamani kpa agbaza Orahab. Owase neshi ebe ko Owuso bwebe ko oko nu la, ishini oza awogyebe ma ki Izrayila wole nu kweyi oki ngmawa bose bwowe oye gogo. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Mani oni, byoni ikpiye ni gbo omaku lo owokwu ni, otuse ni gboko lo owokwu.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Igbenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Ayene hin, nwashika kala naka wawo foza lo. Byoni ala gye ni, aha ni ba foza ni pini aba kwaha epwo she la. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Kpiri kaha ishi nwashika aba nyowe. Owoni ase ke nyowe ela koka lo, owase neshi ni ya gege ya kwiyi nu ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Aba ya arijemu ya lo onya okwunu ko yo na geyagye daha, shini ona ga agbabo ni aba yimu ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Kwe ala rela ko owu kinyo gyokwu ni owu loshu ya gege ko pyo ni, ese titi ya gege ko po, kweyi oya ga agbabo ni opowu ya yimu nu ko ga ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Mamani pini owe la kpi igbenu: koni ole titi ni, oya yoza nyakwu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Ogye mo ikpo ko ola titi ya gege ya yi imweshi yola. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Igbenu lema byola la. Owese ko oza bibi, ogbebe ko yagye nu ikpiye. Oya gege ya kpo obibi ya shase ikpiye kpiri. Igbenu ya gege ko ya ase ikpiye yishi kpo ola ni webe nu bwa aleku ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Aha asuse ba gege ko yo ojoji ni Owuso ya ni shetu, ke ebe ki ikyashi, ki igbano, oza ni ba pyipu agye ni kpe ebinyi kpiri. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Ashishe ke ya gege ko yi igbenu shetu lo. Owoza bibi kweyi ashishe ya gege ya kwo lo, onwonwu kpe efa ko ngmase. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Aba yoko kpa anu ko sha Adole kpa Ada ka iye, aki ba yase okwunu kpa anu, ase ni Owuso yuwa lema byi iyi nu ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Ela ko shotunehe kpe esasosa ba bose bwo okwunu oye kponu. Ayene hin, oshu ko lemani lo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Inyo neshi kpi inyo ni lono ba lu bwi ibwu oye kponu lo. <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Ayene hin, efu ko ofig ya gbo ogwogwa ke epa lo; efu ki inabi ke ya gbo ogwogwa ko ofig lo, ibwu ko onwa ya gbi inyo neshi lo.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oziyi Bwi Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ashe ipu kala gboziyi kpo ogyogye? Ona sayi bwebe koyagye neshi nu, bwebe koko neshi nu noya kpo zikweyi iso lo kpo oziyi nu. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Owoni ala ke yipu kpokpo kpafu yoya teba otu kala, ka gwabotu kpanu lo kweyi ka tela ko kwokwoshi lo. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Edo ko oziyi mani bwi iso pini wa la lo; owa kese la, owa ko omaku la lo, ki ibiri la. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ebeni ase ba kpipu kpafu yoya, oni ya kyebe ki ya bye edo ko ozalabi kpiri yawa. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Oziyi ni ke wa bwiso ikyikyo wo oneshi; oki gbo omene, kweyi zikweyi iso lo kweyi ya rema kase; ogbiyinyinyi, kweyi yase ya kyizire ko oko neshi; oya yase ya gbo okwokwoshi kweyi ya yoza iyi lo. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Awino yimu ko omene ni ti izire ipu ko omene ni ba kyi izire ko oza neshi.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Oya Kese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Oji ya byo onu kpa apwo wipu kala? Obwebe kimu kiyo kese ni ya kpefu ipu kala ni la lo? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ala ba yimu koza, ala ke pye lo, mani oni ala ba ngmase kweyi ba re oshu, ala ke pyoza ni ala ba yimu ni lo, ala ba gbapwo ba nonu. Ala gbo lo ikweyi koni ala do Owuso oka lo ni. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Kweyi ishini ala doka, ala ba pye lo, ikweyi koni ala doka kpo otu neshi lo; ala ba doka koza ko yoko kpanu ebe ko yi ngmo shi ikpiye. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Ala agbaza! Ala gye mo oya kese wo omonyekwotu ko Owuso la lo? Ase ni woya kese, owo omonyekwotu ko Owuso. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Kwe ala ba ma mo oza ni Okpa ko Owuso ka ni wo yeye la, ni omo, &lt;&lt;Omaku ko Owuso ni yipu kaha ni ya kpipu kotata.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Owuso ke fo oneshi manu daha. Byoni Okpa ko Owuso ka mo, &lt;&lt;Awino zikweyi iso Owuso ya tasuweyi, awase ni ke ba zikweyi iso lo ni, Owuso ya yuwo oneshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Mani oni, ala yiyi kala do Owuso, ala tela ki ibiri, oya nyinya shala bita. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Ala sha bo Owuso, anu ki ya sha bala. Yabo kala na, ala awine ko ozalabi! Ala yotu kala na awino yo oza iyi! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ala byotu, ala kyegba kpi ize iyi; ala yeye kala pya wegba kyokye, otunehe kala na pya wotu byobya! <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ala ziyi kala wojije lo obutu ka Adole, anu ya nga ala iso.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi Ikweyi ko Kwase Epwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Ayene hin, ala ka kwiyi kala epwo lo, owoni okwi inogboso Oyesu epwo, okwo Ono ko Owuso epwo oma. Owoni oke kwo Ono ko Owuso epwo, owino gboso Ono la lo, oke wino kwe epwo la. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Owuso fufunu pini ya dase ono, ki ya kepwo la. Anu fufunu pini ya dase olayi, ki ya yase ngmo la. Awo wanoho, ko kwashe epwo?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi Ikweyi ko Gwabotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Anani ala ya kpaha tagye shini ala pwo, awino kamo &lt;&lt;Ikyeni, kwe okyi aha ba gogya nyakwu oni ga yagye kishayi oye kweyi kwotu ko yotoyu shini na pyi ikwiri nwashika.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Ala ke gyoza ni olayi kala ya we okyi ni lo! Olayi kala lema byo owula ke ebwu, oya bose ishi gbayayi oki ya gebi nu. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Oza ni ala shu ko ka ni yoma: &lt;&lt;Owoni Owuso kyogwu, aba gbo olayi kweyi aba yoza mani kpo olamu oni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Anani ke, ala ba zikweyi iso kweyi ba gwabotu; edo ko gwabotu mani ke shoshi lo. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Mani oni, owoni ogyoza ni oshu ko ya ni, kweyi oya lo, oyo ozalabi la.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Akpaha pyopyi ka Awolodu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Anani, ala awolodu ala pwo! Ala sheha kpe egba kyokye ikweyi ko owe ni yawa tala ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Odu kala kwobonu kwoka wa, kweyi Oshiye kala wo ozarore ke eha. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ozinariya kpa azurupa kala kwoka wa, kweyi okwoka mani yawa wi iwene ikweyi kala kweyi ya yala ikpiye byo ola. Ala kpo odu tukpa nwashika ishini ese ya wo okweyi mani. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ala tela ko dawase ni yoko eho kala ni abola ko oko wa. Ala pwa akyose wa! Egba kawase ni yoko ipu ki izire kala ni fa akpaha ko Owuso, Adole ine koshu kpiri. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ipu koyagye kese, ala gbojoji ni ala ba doka ni kweyi ala monye kese. Ala yiyi kala gyokwu byo obize ya gbeyi keno ni aba shuwoko ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Awase ni gbepwo lo ni ala kwuwepwo kweyi yuwa ngmo, ake tasala eyi lo.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otuzoze kpi Inarigwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ayene hin, ala zotu gbishi ko wowa ka Adole. Ala ma awosheho ni ba zotu ba gbeyi gbishini eho wa yawa mizire kowada. Aba zotu ba gbeyi ko Owuso gbobi go okweyi ko ogwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Ala zotu mamani. Ala yi iyitagye neneshi ikweyi koni eno ko wowa ka Adole baha piya.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ayene hin, ala ka kakyose ikweyi kiyikala lo, shini Owuso naka kwala epwo lo. Ino kepwo kwobonu hagye owe kofunu wa. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ayene hin, ala rela kawo bane ni kela ikweyi ka Adole ni. Ala fu bwebe wa ko ozotu kpo owe moma. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Aba yuwogwu ma awine kotunehe ikweyi koni azotu ni. Ala pwela kotu zoze ka Ayuba, kweyi ala moza ni Adole danu ogwejeji ni. Koni Adole wine ki iyinyinyi oki ya tase abo.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Oni she kpiri ni, ayene hin, ala ka yiyikala ki iso kwo okpagye kwe iye kojije lo. Ee kala na wo ee, kweyi aayi kala na wo aayi, shini Owuso naka kwala epwo lo.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Owoni ashe ipu kala ya mowe, ona tinarigwu. Owoni ashe ipu kala ya shotunehe, ona wigye sho Owuso iye. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Owoni ashe ipu kala ya gbere, ona ya awanyakwase ko oda ko Owuso ogwu, shini ana wa tinarigwu danu ba nya ano ipu kiye ka Adole. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Inarigwu ko otuse ya di ine ke ere ogege ki ikpiye; Adole ya dano ogege ki ikpiye, kweyi owoni oyo ozalabi oya rigbo. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Mani oni, ala ko ozalabi ni ala ya ni diyi kala, kweyi ala tinarigwu diyi kala, shini ala pyo ogege ki ikpiye. Inarigwu kase neshi gboshu kotata kweyi ya yo oko. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Iliya wa asuse byaha la. Otinarigwu loshu, loshu mo owuso naka yiwo lo, owuso ke yiwo lo ki ishayi eta kpo oya ihiri. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Oki tinarigwu, iso shonu ki inyo, okpagye yi izire neshi.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Ayene hin, owoni ashe ipu kala showe kokwokwoshi bita, kweyi ashe ipu kala ki kwikye anu wa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />ala rela mani: ase ni kwikye ine ko ozalabi wi ikweyi ko owe ongmo omaku nu shi ikwu kweyi yo ozalabi nwashika bya.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>